   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 6,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## A mask that moves\n\n**kubakub mask field** turns regions into a grey ramp (here: the distance from each window's edge; nothing connected = the windows of the sample facade). **kubakub mask animate** runs an effect along it: a band starts on every beat and leaves a short trail.\n\nTry: `effect` reveal / rings / move x / rotate, `curve` sine / square / noise, drag on the curve for the speed. Connect your own regions to the field and your own sound to `audio`. The masks go into any node that takes a mask, or as a layer mask into the kubakub director."
   ]
  }
 ],
